WEBVTT

00:00:37.670 --> 00:00:38.670
Yuufa...

00:00:38.670 --> 00:00:39.530
Huh?!

00:00:39.530 --> 00:00:41.370
My dear, younger sister...

00:00:41.370 --> 00:00:43.460
Oh... it's you, Big Brother Keough.

00:00:45.640 --> 00:00:48.540
My little sister,
I am grateful to you.

00:00:48.540 --> 00:00:52.980
Thanks to you, a new world will be born.

00:00:52.980 --> 00:00:55.980
You don't need to thank me...

00:00:55.980 --> 00:00:59.890
I wanted only to help you,
Big Brother.

00:00:59.890 --> 00:01:02.790
Is that why you left Roan?

00:01:02.790 --> 00:01:05.490
Th-That's...

00:01:08.230 --> 00:01:11.200
Yuufa, you love-starved lass...

00:01:11.200 --> 00:01:15.400
Stay by me, and you will never have to go through that again.

00:01:15.400 --> 00:01:17.170
I'm so glad, Big Brother.

00:01:17.170 --> 00:01:19.710
What will I need to do?

00:01:19.710 --> 00:01:22.780
All you have do is stay right here.

00:01:22.780 --> 00:01:23.770
What?

00:01:26.310 --> 00:01:28.780
B-Big Brother...

00:01:28.780 --> 00:01:31.010
No... this can't be...

00:01:39.490 --> 00:01:42.730
Brother, I... I...

00:02:00.580 --> 00:02:03.520
Just two more until I can return...

00:02:13.160 --> 00:02:15.600
<i>We are the stars</i>

00:02:15.600 --> 00:02:19.570
<i>We dash across the skies</i>

00:02:19.570 --> 00:02:22.070
<i>You are my star</i>

00:02:22.070 --> 00:02:26.570
<i>A priceless love</i>

00:02:26.570 --> 00:02:32.380
<i>El Dorado,</i> <i>rising up above the dust clouds</i>

00:02:32.380 --> 00:02:36.320
<i>We are journey to the stars</i>

00:02:40.360 --> 00:02:44.430
<i>The dream I saw before I awoke</i>

00:02:44.430 --> 00:02:51.730
<i>Will surely come true, so never forget it</i>

00:02:53.200 --> 00:02:57.270
<i>Searching for a sliver in time passing by</i>

00:02:57.270 --> 00:03:04.410
<i>Where I belong, those days are over now</i>

00:03:05.910 --> 00:03:09.880
<i>Silhouettes outlining the shapes of clouds</i>

00:03:09.880 --> 00:03:12.320
<i>Farther and farther</i>

00:03:12.320 --> 00:03:19.260
<i>I want to keep looking for</i> <i>the promised land I saw in my dreams</i>

00:03:19.260 --> 00:03:21.530
<i>We are the stars</i>

00:03:21.530 --> 00:03:25.600
<i>Like a shining arrow</i>

00:03:25.600 --> 00:03:28.100
<i>You are my star</i>

00:03:28.100 --> 00:03:32.640
<i>Unfailing strength</i>

00:03:32.640 --> 00:03:38.450
<i>The panorama that spreads before us,</i> <i>beyond the darkness</i>

00:03:38.450 --> 00:03:41.350
<i>We are journey to the stars</i>

00:03:57.570 --> 00:03:59.060
Now, little Prince...

00:04:01.570 --> 00:04:03.870
your Princess awaits you!

00:04:03.870 --> 00:04:05.770
How dare you!

00:04:05.770 --> 00:04:08.000
No! Don't get too close...

00:04:16.920 --> 00:04:19.150
One-track minded fool!

00:04:21.820 --> 00:04:23.560
Then I'm not the only one!

00:04:23.560 --> 00:04:24.720
What?!

00:04:38.540 --> 00:04:42.240
Are you <i>that</i> anxious to have it out with me, Iruga?

00:04:42.240 --> 00:04:43.340
Keough!

00:04:44.880 --> 00:04:46.710
C'mon, let's go.

00:04:46.710 --> 00:04:48.180
Judia-<i>san</i>!

00:04:48.180 --> 00:04:48.920
But...

00:04:48.920 --> 00:04:50.920
But nothing!

00:04:50.920 --> 00:04:53.720
A battle to the end is Iruga's destiny!

00:04:53.720 --> 00:04:55.380
It's not our business!

00:04:58.730 --> 00:05:02.300
Magnum...

00:05:02.300 --> 00:05:03.290
...Break!

00:05:11.940 --> 00:05:12.930
Keough!

00:05:15.440 --> 00:05:20.320
Iruga, did you think you could defeat me with those wounds?!

00:05:20.320 --> 00:05:23.650
Beating you never crossed my mind.

00:05:23.650 --> 00:05:24.640
What?!

00:05:31.130 --> 00:05:33.250
It's just the two of us now, at last!

00:05:40.800 --> 00:05:42.640
Hurry up, you!

00:05:42.640 --> 00:05:43.910
But!

00:05:43.910 --> 00:05:47.040
In his condition, Iruga can't defeat Keough by himself!

00:05:47.040 --> 00:05:49.040
We have to help him!

00:05:49.040 --> 00:05:50.340
Never mind!

00:05:51.950 --> 00:05:53.280
Never mind.

00:05:57.150 --> 00:05:59.280
Hurry! Hurry!

00:06:09.430 --> 00:06:12.570
Iruga asked me to protect you...

00:06:12.570 --> 00:06:14.970
And rescue Yuufa...

00:06:14.970 --> 00:06:17.270
so I...

00:06:17.270 --> 00:06:18.760
Judia-<i>san...</i>

00:06:24.510 --> 00:06:25.840
Why you-

00:06:29.320 --> 00:06:30.480
Big Bro!

00:06:31.490 --> 00:06:32.650
Damn!

00:06:36.720 --> 00:06:41.890
So quit worrying about others and do what you have to do!

00:06:43.300 --> 00:06:44.320
Right!

00:06:45.930 --> 00:06:48.270
<i>Yuufa, wait for me...</i>

00:06:49.370 --> 00:06:51.470
<i>I'm on my way.</i>

00:06:51.470 --> 00:06:53.870
Big Bro, they're back!

00:07:02.780 --> 00:07:04.150
Don't interfere!

00:07:07.320 --> 00:07:09.310
Move it!

00:07:21.300 --> 00:07:24.470
You have yet to realize the ultimate truth.

00:07:24.470 --> 00:07:30.140
One cannot attain the ultimate truth in this world by listening to others.

00:07:30.140 --> 00:07:35.650
What is needed is a single absolute.

00:07:35.650 --> 00:07:40.210
People can attain bliss when led by a singular, powerful, ultimate truth.

00:07:47.330 --> 00:07:50.670
People will not accept an ultimate truth that rejects...

00:07:50.670 --> 00:07:52.670
...those who don't agree with you!

00:07:52.670 --> 00:07:55.570
Then tell me, what have <i>they</i> done?

00:07:55.570 --> 00:07:57.670
Without understanding those who seek,

00:07:57.670 --> 00:08:01.300
they ridiculed, criticized, and censured us!

00:08:03.440 --> 00:08:07.280
Without tainting their own hands, they stood on their lofty perches,

00:08:07.280 --> 00:08:10.220
banded together, and expelled the "heretics."

00:08:10.220 --> 00:08:13.960
Their kind have no reason to exist but to serve...

00:08:13.960 --> 00:08:16.420
...as fodder for my quest for the ultimate truth!

00:08:17.690 --> 00:08:19.460
That isn't so!

00:08:22.400 --> 00:08:25.060
Fire Wall!

00:08:31.310 --> 00:08:34.640
What're you talking about, Takius-<i>kun</i>?

00:08:35.640 --> 00:08:38.650
Every person's life has meaning.

00:08:38.650 --> 00:08:40.480
Every person wants to live.

00:08:40.480 --> 00:08:44.150
They do not live for others.
They live for themselves!

00:08:45.490 --> 00:08:47.820
For their own happiness!

00:08:55.660 --> 00:09:00.170
A magician's magic again?
I'm disappointed.

00:09:00.170 --> 00:09:03.540
Why did you choose to become a Sage?

00:09:05.640 --> 00:09:08.110
I became a Sage...

00:09:16.980 --> 00:09:21.720
...to repent for my previous actions!

00:09:21.720 --> 00:09:24.630
The same magic again?!

00:09:24.630 --> 00:09:26.790
Sightrasher!

00:09:32.330 --> 00:09:33.490
What the-

00:09:45.780 --> 00:09:48.620
I see... the earlier magic was Deluge.

00:09:48.620 --> 00:09:52.020
A magic that amplified your water powers!

00:09:52.020 --> 00:09:56.350
Now, let me show you what I can do.

00:09:59.990 --> 00:10:03.160
<i>How? How are you able</i> <i>to use Water Balls?!</i>

00:10:05.770 --> 00:10:11.100
The best should always be kept for last, Takius-<i>kun</i>!

00:10:19.910 --> 00:10:21.910
Nothing left?

00:10:43.300 --> 00:10:44.360
Well then...

00:10:45.370 --> 00:10:48.710
Let's stop wasting any more time.

00:11:24.510 --> 00:11:25.570
Well then...

00:11:26.580 --> 00:11:29.910
Let's stop wasting any more time.

00:12:09.190 --> 00:12:10.730
Do you understand now?

00:12:10.730 --> 00:12:13.530
My ultimate truth is everything in this world.

00:12:13.530 --> 00:12:18.600
Anyone who defies me meets an unfortunate end.

00:12:18.600 --> 00:12:20.760
I refuse...

00:12:24.370 --> 00:12:27.740
I refuse... to accept that!

00:12:29.540 --> 00:12:31.610
There is but one truth.

00:12:31.610 --> 00:12:35.020
You mustn't turn away from it.
Oh, I forgot...

00:12:35.020 --> 00:12:39.750
It was I who made you close your eyes, wasn't it, Takius-<i>kun...</i>

00:12:39.750 --> 00:12:43.520
...or should I say, Catherine?

00:12:45.830 --> 00:12:47.020
Don't you ever...

00:12:50.130 --> 00:12:54.300
...call me by that name!

00:12:59.040 --> 00:13:00.530
Spell Breaker!

00:13:26.200 --> 00:13:29.260
You must find this easy- you're distracted.

00:13:30.400 --> 00:13:33.540
Say, what happened to your friends?

00:13:33.540 --> 00:13:35.880
Think maybe they're already dead?

00:13:35.880 --> 00:13:39.880
Or maybe they're burning in agony in the fires of hell?

00:13:39.880 --> 00:13:46.150
The way I did when you forsook me!

00:13:47.190 --> 00:13:49.850
Your attempts to rattle me won't work.

00:13:57.200 --> 00:13:58.300
What was that?!

00:13:58.300 --> 00:13:59.370
They're coming!

00:13:59.370 --> 00:14:00.360
Poring!

00:14:13.780 --> 00:14:18.190
When I removed my blindfold,
I learned the truth about the world.

00:14:18.190 --> 00:14:20.050
There is not just one ultimate truth.

00:14:20.050 --> 00:14:24.090
Everyone possesses their own ultimate truth.

00:14:24.090 --> 00:14:28.500
As a result, sometimes they clash or take perplexing actions,

00:14:28.500 --> 00:14:29.990
but they all go on living.

00:14:31.470 --> 00:14:33.600
What nonsense is that?

00:14:33.600 --> 00:14:36.840
That is precisely the root of their troubles.

00:14:36.840 --> 00:14:42.140
Individuals doing their own thing bring tragedy to this world!

00:14:42.140 --> 00:14:43.540
But it's okay.

00:14:43.540 --> 00:14:47.210
My ultimate truth will save the people.

00:14:47.210 --> 00:14:51.020
Then why did you have to murder Humans and Monsters?

00:14:58.090 --> 00:15:01.000
It was all a game, Takius-<i>kun.</i>

00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:04.730
They were nothing more than my pawns.

00:15:04.730 --> 00:15:08.140
Disposable pawns to aid me in grasping the ultimate truth.

00:15:08.140 --> 00:15:10.070
How could you?

00:15:10.070 --> 00:15:14.240
Aren't you the very one who tainted your hands to that end?

00:15:14.240 --> 00:15:17.970
Of course, you were a pawn as well.

00:15:20.210 --> 00:15:22.550
That's not...

00:15:22.550 --> 00:15:24.540
...That's not so!

00:15:28.990 --> 00:15:32.820
Very well, let's enjoy this to its conclusion.

00:15:34.030 --> 00:15:36.500
It's too bad you hurt your leg,

00:15:36.500 --> 00:15:39.300
even though it happened while stopping the meteor storm.

00:15:39.300 --> 00:15:43.400
You won't be able to dodge my next attack.

00:15:51.050 --> 00:15:53.950
Lord of...

00:15:56.420 --> 00:15:59.680
...Vermilion!

00:16:05.290 --> 00:16:07.290
Better get away quickly,

00:16:07.290 --> 00:16:10.830
or you'll disappear like dew from my Lord of Vermilion.

00:16:10.830 --> 00:16:15.500
If you manage to escape,
I'll spare your life.

00:16:18.370 --> 00:16:20.810
Not much time left.

00:16:20.810 --> 00:16:22.570
You'd better hurry.

00:16:26.150 --> 00:16:28.980
It looks like this is really good-bye.

00:16:35.520 --> 00:16:39.150
Zephyrus-<i>kun</i>, that won't do.

00:16:46.730 --> 00:16:47.970
<i>Sensei</i>?!

00:16:47.970 --> 00:16:51.200
Wh-What's going on?
What is this?!

00:16:55.780 --> 00:16:56.940
Curse you!

00:16:58.750 --> 00:17:01.680
Why... Why me?

00:17:04.890 --> 00:17:10.550
Zephyrus-<i>kun</i>, I need your soul to make my return.

00:17:14.060 --> 00:17:15.630
So that's how it was...

00:17:15.630 --> 00:17:23.900
I see now... I, too, was a mere pawn...

00:17:29.240 --> 00:17:31.970
<i>Sensei</i>!

00:17:44.430 --> 00:17:46.660
What're you doing?!

00:17:49.260 --> 00:17:51.700
I lost the game.

00:17:51.700 --> 00:17:53.670
I am a fool who so clung...

00:17:53.670 --> 00:17:57.540
...to my ultimate truth that
I lost sight of what was important.

00:17:57.540 --> 00:18:00.340
I do not deserve to go on living...

00:18:00.340 --> 00:18:04.780
You must surpass me and pursue your own ultimate truth!

00:18:04.780 --> 00:18:07.580
My ultimate truth tells me
I cannot forsake one...

00:18:07.580 --> 00:18:09.640
...who has realized the error in his ways!

00:18:15.060 --> 00:18:16.850
Takius-<i>kun...</i>

00:18:17.860 --> 00:18:19.190
<i>Sensei</i> Zephyrus...

00:18:49.990 --> 00:18:51.890
Takius...

00:18:51.890 --> 00:18:54.060
Now what?!

00:18:54.060 --> 00:18:55.150
Maaya!

00:18:59.430 --> 00:19:01.600
What's the matter, Maaya?

00:19:01.600 --> 00:19:02.930
Are you all right?

00:19:10.480 --> 00:19:15.280
Those who cling to one thing are so easily manipulated.

00:19:20.520 --> 00:19:25.360
Zephyrus-<i>kun</i>, your ultimate truth has come in quite handy.

00:19:25.360 --> 00:19:27.960
It won't be long now until I can return.

00:19:27.960 --> 00:19:30.800
Eliminate the intruders.

00:19:50.180 --> 00:19:53.090
We've come a long way.

00:19:53.090 --> 00:19:54.650
But, where is Yuufa?

00:19:57.560 --> 00:20:00.790
Yuufa is just up ahead.
I'm positive!

00:20:00.790 --> 00:20:02.390
Are you sure?

00:20:04.130 --> 00:20:05.170
What was that?!

00:20:05.170 --> 00:20:07.160
Big Bro, over there!

00:20:25.690 --> 00:20:26.680
Maaya!

00:20:30.020 --> 00:20:31.190
Damn!

00:20:31.190 --> 00:20:34.030
Roan! Leave this place to me.

00:20:34.030 --> 00:20:35.360
Judia-<i>san</i>?!

00:20:35.360 --> 00:20:38.030
You go to Yuufa!

00:20:40.530 --> 00:20:41.700
All right.

00:20:45.210 --> 00:20:48.040
<i>Forgive me, Maaya...</i>
<i>Hang in there just a little while...</i>

00:20:59.390 --> 00:21:02.980
Okay, take your best shot!

00:21:21.410 --> 00:21:23.380
Yuufa!

00:21:23.380 --> 00:21:25.680
Yuufa, I'm here to rescue you.

00:21:27.010 --> 00:21:28.180
Yuufa?

00:21:32.990 --> 00:21:34.520
Roan...

00:21:34.520 --> 00:21:35.850
Yuufa...

00:21:42.360 --> 00:21:44.530
Roan...

00:21:44.530 --> 00:21:47.870
Yuufa... what's the matter?

00:22:13.090 --> 00:22:16.660
Y-Yuufa... what did you...

00:22:18.330 --> 00:22:22.000
So, how does the Cursed Ruby taste?

00:22:28.280 --> 00:22:29.270
Yuu-

00:22:34.780 --> 00:22:44.780
<i>Unable to even find a way</i> <i>to regain the strength we lost</i>

00:22:45.530 --> 00:22:53.630
<i>Here we are, beneath this vast sky</i>

00:22:53.630 --> 00:22:58.470
<i>The shining cradle of green</i>

00:22:58.470 --> 00:23:03.340
<i>Is a merry-go-round that</i> <i>will never stop turning</i>

00:23:03.340 --> 00:23:08.120
<i>Greater than any jewel</i> <i>in this world</i>

00:23:08.120 --> 00:23:12.450
<i>It is a precious treasure</i>

00:23:12.450 --> 00:23:22.450
<i>The endless journey leads</i> <i>to our tomorrow</i>

00:23:31.300 --> 00:23:34.670
<i>Yuufa, there's something</i>
<i>I've wanted to tell you...</i>

00:23:34.670 --> 00:23:37.180
<i>It's about my feelings for you.</i>

00:23:37.180 --> 00:23:40.510
<i>It was my own decision</i> <i>to want to protect you.</i>

00:23:40.510 --> 00:23:43.020
<i>Next time,</i> "For the Sake of Our Future."

00:23:43.020 --> 00:23:45.010
<i>Yuufa, I...</i>
